# Website (Astro)

## Role

`apps/website` is the **marketing / legal / waitlist** surface. It is not the mobile app,
not the future product web app (`apps/web`), and not a full product SPA unless the human
explicitly expands scope.

## Stack discipline

- Static-first Astro pages.
- Use React islands only when interactivity truly needs them.
- Do not introduce Next.js, Remix, or a design-system rewrite for marketing pages.

## Sharing

- Brand tokens: vendored at `apps/website/src/brand/tokens.css` (sync from `@product/brand` via `make sync-brand-tokens`).
- Do **not** share React Native components with the website.
- Waitlist uses Formspree (`PUBLIC_WAITLIST_FORM_URL`) — no API dependency for marketing deploy.

## SEO and legal

Every public page needs sound metadata. Privacy/terms stay real pages, not placeholders that ship empty.
